= John Nott

[? if con_in_government = 0 : Shadow Trade Secretary. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 and time < 45 : Secretary of State for Trade. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 and time >= 45 : Secretary of State for Defence. ?] A former Gurkha officer and merchant banker. He is an economic dry with no sentimentality about institutions, the Navy included.

- @free_trade
- @price_commission
- @defence_review
- @task_force
- @root: Return

@free_trade
title: Champion free trade
view-if: con_in_government = 0
subtitle: Business and the City approve.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; economic_liberalism += 2; ab_con += 1*(1-dissent); c1_con += 1*(1-dissent)

Nott promises to abolish the Price Commission, dismantle Labour's industrial strategy and let British firms sink or swim.

@price_commission
title: Abolish the Price Commission
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and price_commission = 0
subtitle: Business is freed. Prices tick up for a while.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; price_commission = 1; economic_liberalism += 2; inflation += 0.3; ab_con += 1*(1-dissent); dry_dissent -= 3

Labour's Price Commission is wound up. Firms no longer need permission to raise their prices, and many of them do.

@defence_review
title: The Way Forward
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and defence_cuts = 0
subtitle: +2 budget. The Navy and the right will be furious, and the South Atlantic will notice.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; defence_cuts = 1; endurance_withdrawn = 1; budget += 2; right_dissent += 6; us_relation -= 3
achievement: the_way_forward

Nott's defence review cuts the surface fleet to pay for the Atlantic submarines and the nuclear deterrent. The Navy Minister resigns in protest. HMS Endurance is to be withdrawn from the South Atlantic.

@task_force
title: Organise the task force
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and falklands = 2
subtitle: Improves the task force's chances.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; falklands_bonus += 6; right_dissent -= 3

Nott requisitions the liners Canberra and QE2, and the Navy refits them as troopships in days. Whatever his review said, the Ministry of Defence works around the clock.
